"nt_telegram_steps": "1. In Telegram talk to @BotFather, send /newbot and keep the token. 2. Open a chat with your bot (or add it to a group) and send it any message. 3. Open https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates in a browser and read \"chat\":{\"id\": ...}. 4. Put ARMOR_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=<token> and ARMOR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_IDS=<id>[,<id>...] in armor.env.",
"nt_ha_steps": "1. In Home Assistant create an automation whose trigger is Webhook and copy its webhook id. 2. Make its action what you want (a notification to the phone, a siren, a light): trigger.json.text is the sentence, trigger.json.title is A.R.M.O.R., and trigger.json.event, node_id, severity, code say what happened. 3. Put ARMOR_HOMEASSISTANT_URL=http://<address>:8123 and ARMOR_HOMEASSISTANT_WEBHOOK_ID=<id> in armor.env. The id is a secret.",
