"bm_image_read": "Read: board {0}, version {1}, {2} KiB",
"bm_image_note": "Use the .bin the maker publishes for exactly this model; if it comes in a .zip, take the .bin out first. The server reads the header of the file and the node refuses to send it unless it fits this battery's model and chip (read from its board and from characters 8 and 9 of its serial number). A wrong image destroys the battery.",
