"bm_expert_line": "Console line",
"bm_expert_note": "One command, at most 48 characters, sent as it is. Commands that have their own operation (updata, eepe, eepw, tbar, flaw, mm and a few more) are blocked here: use the operation. The answer is shown below, with the service password always hidden.",
